### ============================================================
### Task Management API - REST Client / HTTP Requests
### ============================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@taskId = 1

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "username": "johndoe",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 1.2 Sign In / Login (Captures Access Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Token dynamically extracted from the signin response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. DASHBOARD
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Get Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. TASKS
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Create a New Task
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Assignment Tasks",
  "description": "Finish backend setup, documentation, and frontend integration",
  "priority": "high"
}

### 3.2 Fetch All Tasks (Paginated, Sorted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?page=1&limit=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.3 Fetch Tasks (Filtered by Status and Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?page=1&limit=10&status=pending&priority=high&search=Assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.4 Fetch Task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.5 Update Task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Assignment Tasks (In Progress)",
  "description": "Reviewing tests and verifying database transactions",
  "status": "inprogress",
  "priority": "high"
}

### 3.6 Soft Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
